{"id":"20fe67463d98fb92","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-godel-pairing.md","title":"Gödel Pairing Function","display":"df-godel-pairing — Gödel Pairing Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-godel-pairing","aliases":["92-df-godel-pairing"],"display":"df-godel-pairing — Gödel Pairing Function","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-godel-pairing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-godel-pairing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-pairing — Gödel Pairing Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,W,J,K,L\">\\(T,W,J,K,L\\)</span> (definition-target triangular-number, diagonal-index, pairing, and inverse maps)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}pairing} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad T(w)\\coloneqq\\frac{w(w+1)}2,\\\\\n&amp;W:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad W(z)\\coloneqq\\max\\{w\\in\\mathbb N\\mid T(w)\\leq z\\},\\\\\n&amp;J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad J(x,y)\\coloneqq T(x+y)+x,\\\\\n&amp;K,L:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad K(z)\\coloneqq z-T(W(z)),\\qquad L(z)\\coloneqq W(z)-K(z).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}pairing} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad T(w)\\coloneqq\\frac{w(w+1)}2,\\\\\n&amp;W:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad W(z)\\coloneqq\\max\\{w\\in\\mathbb N\\mid T(w)\\leq z\\},\\\\\n&amp;J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad J(x,y)\\coloneqq T(x+y)+x,\\\\\n&amp;K,L:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad K(z)\\coloneqq z-T(W(z)),\\qquad L(z)\\coloneqq W(z)-K(z).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(x, y)\">\\(J(x, y)\\)</span>：Cantor配对函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(z)\">\\(K(z)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(z)\">\\(L(z)\\)</span>：逆投影函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(J(x,y)) = x\">\\(K(J(x,y)) = x\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(J(x,y)) = y\">\\(L(J(x,y)) = y\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W(z)\">\\(W(z)\\)</span> 给出唯一满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(W(z))\\leq z&lt;T(W(z)+1)\">\\(T(W(z))\\leq z&lt;T(W(z)+1)\\)</span> 的对角线编号，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,L\">\\(K,L\\)</span> 无需未证的描述算子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J, K, L\">\\(J, K, L\\)</span>都是原始递归函数</li>\n<li>配对函数用于将多元组编码为单个自然数</li>\n<li>Gödel编码序列的基础工具</li>\n<li>可迭代编码：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a, b, c \\rangle = J(a, J(b, c))\">\\(\\langle a, b, c \\rangle = J(a, J(b, c))\\)</span></li>\n<li>使得多元函数可化为一元函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,W,J,K,L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}pairing} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad T(w)\\coloneqq\\frac{w(w+1)}2,\\\\\n&W:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad W(z)\\coloneqq\\max\\{w\\in\\mathbb N\\mid T(w)\\leq z\\},\\\\\n&J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad J(x,y)\\coloneqq T(x+y)+x,\\\\\n&K,L:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad K(z)\\coloneqq z-T(W(z)),\\qquad L(z)\\coloneqq W(z)-K(z).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"J(x, y)","display":false},{"tex":"K(z)","display":false},{"tex":"L(z)","display":false},{"tex":"K(J(x,y)) = x","display":false},{"tex":"L(J(x,y)) = y","display":false},{"tex":"W(z)","display":false},{"tex":"T(W(z))\\leq z<T(W(z)+1)","display":false},{"tex":"K,L","display":false},{"tex":"J, K, L","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a, b, c \\rangle = J(a, J(b, c))","display":false}],"bytes":1259,"backlinks":[{"id":"19c8b0267ad22ce9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ (fixed injective pairing map, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])"},{"id":"afb378126cbf5f83","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ (pairing function, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])"},{"id":"d03aab2a94232c0e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ (Cantor pairing bijection, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])"},{"id":"5984f0527f1f4cba","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J$ (pairing encoder, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])"},{"id":"27fab6bb26120749","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J$ (pairing encoder, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])"},{"id":"5d4eae4b8b30ad03","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J$ (pairing encoder, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])"},{"id":"bf315ef87cd91c88","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J$ (pairing encoder, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])"},{"id":"d4d05fd5fa8e94bc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$J: \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}$ (pairing function, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])"},{"id":"893064ec9f8dc7f0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2d2cf287148220bf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"04751f66804591ae","anchor":"ref-5","locations